<%# "Trending Articles" is ranked from Plausible analytics at request time by the API and %>
<%# swapped in by the live-update controller (which removes it when nothing is trending). %>
<%# `url` (required local) is the API endpoint: the bare trending path, or /:id carrying the %>
<%# sys.id of the current article, so trending doesn't list the post you're reading. %>
<%= partial 'partials/placeholders/article_collection', locals: { section_id: 'trending-articles', heading: 'Trending Articles', url: url } %>
